1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,900
Huh? Did I feed her?

2
00:00:03,430 --> 00:00:04,250
I fed her.

3
00:00:04,250 --> 00:00:06,440
At three a.m., nobody remembers anything.

4
00:00:06,440 --> 00:00:09,040
Two-ten. Left side.

5
00:00:10,140 --> 00:00:11,640
You were snoring.

6
00:00:11,850 --> 00:00:13,750
Bottle, ninety mils.

7
00:00:13,850 --> 00:00:17,950
Now I just whisper to my watch. My phone understands it, right there.

8
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:20,920
My wife sees it on hers, and goes back to sleep.

9
00:00:21,000 --> 00:00:23,680
Baby asleep? Not a word. I just tilt my wrist.

10
00:00:23,900 --> 00:00:25,750
Two cookies. Logged.

11
00:00:26,850 --> 00:00:29,770
Wee Hours. A newborn log built for three a.m.
